<title>SWITZERLAND: TENNIS-SWITZERLAND LEAD MOROCCO 2-0 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SWITZERLAND LEAD MOROCCO 2-0 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>OLTEN, Switzerland 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Switzerland took a</p>
<p>2-0 lead over Morocco in their Davis Cup World Group qualifying</p>
<p>round tie after winning the opening singles matches on Friday.</p>
<p>Results:</p>
<p>Jakob Hlasek beat Mehdi Tahiri 0-6 6-3 6-2 7-5</p>
<p>Marc Rosset beat Mounir El Aarej 6-0 6-1 6-3</p>
</text>
